==History==
2016
*The Skeleton Army [[Cards|card]] was added with Clash Royale's game launch on 4/1/2016.
*On 19/2/2016, a [[Version History#Balance Changes (19/2/2016)|Balance Update]], increased the [[Skeletons]]' hitpoints and damage by 11%.
*On 29/2/2016, the [[Version History#March 2016 Update (29/2/2016)|March 2016 Update]], decreased the Skeletons' sight range to 5.5 tiles (from 6 tiles).
*On 3/5/2016, the [[Version History#May%202016%20Update%20(3/5/2016)|May 2016 Update]], fixed the "range bug" and decreased the Skeletons' range to 0.5 tiles (from 0.75 tiles), but their effective range is unchanged.
*On 18/5/2016, a [[Version History#Balance Changes (18/5/2016)|Balance Update]], increased the Skeletons' hitpoints and damage by 5%.
*On 4/7/2016, the [[Version History#Tournaments Update (4/7/2016)|Tournaments Update]], increased the number of Skeletons spawned to 21 (from 20) and compressed the spawning pattern of the Skeleton Army when the card is deployed by the river. Previously, the Skeletons would spawn on top of the river, even in enemy territory. Its description was also changed, adding the word "Ledoot" on it.
*On 20/10/2016, a [[Version History#Balance Changes (20/10/2016)|Balance Update]], decreased the Skeleton Army's cost to 3 [[Elixir]] (from 4 Elixir), increased the Skeletons' Levels by 5 (to match the [[Tournament|Tournament Standard]]) and decreased the number of Skeletons spawned to 16 (from 21).
*On 1/11/2016, the [[Version History#November 2016 Update (1/11/2016)|November 2016 Update]], removed the word "Ledoot" from its description.
2017 
*On 13/2/2017, a [[Version History#Balance Changes (13/2/2017)|Balance Update]], decreased the number of Skeletons spawned to 15 (from 16).
*On 19/4/2017, a [[Version History#Balance Changes (19/4/2017)|Balance Update]], decreased the number of Skeletons spawned to 14 (from 15).
*On 9/10/2017, the [[Version History#Epic Quests Update (9/10/2017)|Epic Quests Update]], changed the card description. Prior to this update, it read "''Summons an army of Skeletons. Meet Larry and his friends Harry, Gerry, Terry, Mary, etc.''".
2018
*On 5/9/2018, the [[Version History#September%202018%20Update%20(5/9/2018)|September 2018 Update]], changed it so that {{Rarity|Epic}} cards start at Level 6 and end at Level 13 (from 1 to 8).
*On 1/10/2018, a [[Version History#Balance Changes (1/10/2018)|Balance Update]], increased the number of Skeletons spawned to 15 (from 14).
2019
*On 15/4/2019, the [[Version History#April%202019%20Update%20(15/4/2019)|April 2019 Update]], added an extra [[Star Points|Star Level]].
*On 26/11/2019, the [[Version History#End%20of%20November%202019%20Update%20(26/11/2019)|End of November 2019 Update]], added a card render to the Skeleton Army's card info screen.
2021
*On 7/6/2021, the [[Version History#Summer%202021%20Update%20(7/6/2021)|Summer 2021 Update]], moved the [[Arenas|Arena]] to unlock the Skeleton Army from [[Training Camp]] to Bone Pit.
*On 2/9/2021, a maintenance break, changed the Skeleton Army's card render.
*On 27/10/2021, the [[Version History#Champions%20Update%20(27/10/2021)|Champions Update]], increased the Level cap of all cards to 14 (from 13).
2022
*On 26/10/2022, the [[Version History#2022%20Quarter%203%20Update%20(26/10/2022)|2022 Quarter 3 Update]], moved the Arena to unlock the Skeleton Army from Bone Pit to P.E.K.K.A's Playhouse.
2023
*On 19/6/2023, the [[Version History#Card%20Evolution%20Update%20(19/6/2023)|Card Evolution Update]], increased the Level cap of all cards to 15 (from 14).
2025
*On 4/8/2025, the [[Version History/2025#Pass Royale and more (4/8/2025)|August 2025 Update]] made it so that the [[Witch/Evolution|Evolved Witch]] would no longer be healed by defeated Skeletons.
*On 2/10/2025, the [[Version History#Pass Royale and more (6/10/2025)|October 2025 Update]], added the Skeleton Army's Evolution
*On 6/10/2025, a [[Version History#Balance Changes (6/10/2025)=|Balance Update]] increased the Skeleton's attack time interval to 1.1 seconds (from 1.0 seconds).

